### Login to get JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get 10-Year CVD Risk Prediction for John Doe (Expected: 24.3%, High Risk)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/predict/cvd/patient-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get SHAP Explainability for John Doe (Expected: HbA1c +8%, BP +6%)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/explain/shap/patient-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Diabetes Multi-Organ Complications Prediction
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/predict/diabetes/patient-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Federated Learning Status (Expected: Round 47, Accuracy 91.4%)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/federated/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trigger Next Federated Training Round (Advances from 47 to 48)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/federated/train-round
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Federated Hospital Nodes (Alpha, Beta, Gamma, Delta)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/federated/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Model Registry Versions (Active: v2.4.0-fed-cvd)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/models
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Complete 6-Screen Validation Suite Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/validation/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
